{"seq":2,"slug":"spring-cloud-contract","title":"Spring Cloud Contract 实践指南","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/contract-testing-cdc/tools/spring-cloud-contract","wordCount":1041,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"spring-cloud-contract-实践指南\">Spring Cloud Contract 实践指南</h1><h2 id=\"spring-cloud-contract-的设计哲学\">Spring Cloud Contract 的设计哲学</h2><p>Spring Cloud Contract（SCC）是 Spring 生态中的契约测试解决方案，由 Pivotal（现 VMware Tanzu）团队开发维护。与 Pact 的消费者驱动模式不同，SCC 默认采用<strong>提供者侧定义契约</strong>的工作流——契约文件与提供者代码放在同一个仓库中，通过 Maven/Gradle 插件自动生成验证测试和 WireMock 存根。</p>\n<p>这种设计反映了 Spring 生态的哲学：<strong>约定优于配置，自动化优于手工</strong>。开发者只需用 Groovy DSL 或 YAML 编写契约定义，SCC 自动完成测试生成、存根发布和消费者端集成。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph 提供者仓库&#10;        CD[契约定义&lt;br/&gt;Groovy/YAML] --&gt; SCC[SCC Maven Plugin]&#10;        SCC --&gt; GT[自动生成验证测试]&#10;        SCC --&gt; WM[自动生成 WireMock 存根]&#10;        GT --&gt; RUN[运行测试验证提供者]&#10;        WM --&gt; PUBLISH[发布存根 JAR 到 Nexus]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph 消费者仓库&#10;        PUBLISH --&gt; SR[Stub Runner]&#10;        SR --&gt; CT[消费者集成测试]&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph 提供者仓库\n        CD[契约定义&lt;br/&gt;Groovy/YAML] --&gt; SCC[SCC Maven Plugin]\n        SCC --&gt; GT[自动生成验证测试]\n        SCC --&gt; WM[自动生成 WireMock 存根]\n        GT --&gt; RUN[运行测试验证提供者]\n        WM --&gt; PUBLISH[发布存根 JAR 到 Nexus]\n    end\n\n    subgraph 消费者仓库\n        PUBLISH --&gt; SR[Stub Runner]\n        SR --&gt; CT[消费者集成测试]\n    end</pre><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Spring Cloud Contract 的核心概念包括：<strong>Contract DSL</strong>——用 Groovy 或 YAML 编写的契约定义语言；<strong>Contract Verifier</strong>——从契约自动生成 JUnit/Spock 测试的 Maven/Gradle 插件；<strong>Stub Runner</strong>——消费者端自动获取并运行 WireMock 存根的组件；<strong>Base Class</strong>——提供者验证测试的测试上下文基类。</p>\n<h2 id=\"契约定义语言\">契约定义语言</h2><p>SCC 支持两种契约定义格式：Groovy DSL（更强大、支持编程逻辑）和 YAML（更简洁、跨语言友好）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"groovy-dsl-示例\">Groovy DSL 示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"groovy\" data-code=\"Contract.make {&#10;    description &quot;should return user by id&quot;&#10;    request {&#10;        method GET()&#10;        url &quot;/users/123&quot;&#10;        headers {&#10;            header(&#39;Authorization&#39;, matching(&#39;Bearer .+&#39;))&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;    response {&#10;        status OK()&#10;        headers {&#10;            contentType applicationJson()&#10;        }&#10;        body([&#10;            id: $(anyNonBlankString()),&#10;            name: $(anyNonBlankString()),&#10;            email: $(regex(&#39;[a-zA-Z0-9.]+@[a-zA-Z0-9]+\\\\.[a-z]{2,}&#39;)),&#10;            role: $(anyOf(&#39;admin&#39;, &#39;user&#39;, &#39;guest&#39;))&#10;        ])&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Contract.make {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    description \"should return user by id\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    request {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        method GET()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        url \"/users/123\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        headers {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            header('Authorization', matching('Bearer .+'))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    response {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        status OK()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        headers {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            contentType applicationJson()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        body([</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            id: $(anyNonBlankString()),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            name: $(anyNonBlankString()),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            email: $(regex('[a-zA-Z0-9.]+@[a-zA-Z0-9]+\\\\.[a-z]{2,}')),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            role: $(anyOf('admin', 'user', 'guest'))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"yaml-格式示例\">YAML 格式示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"description: should return user by id&#10;request:&#10;  method: GET&#10;  url: /users/123&#10;  headers:&#10;    Authorization: Bearer {token}&#10;  matchers:&#10;    headers:&#10;      - key: Authorization&#10;        regex: &#39;Bearer .+&#39;&#10;response:&#10;  status: 200&#10;  headers:&#10;    Content-Type: application/json&#10;  body:&#10;    id: &#39;abc-123&#39;&#10;    name: &#39;Alice&#39;&#10;    email: &#39;alice@example.com&#39;&#10;  matchers:&#10;    body:&#10;      - path: $.id&#10;        type: by_type&#10;      - path: $.email&#10;        type: by_regex&#10;        value: &quot;[a-zA-Z0-9.]+@[a-zA-Z0-9]+\\\\.[a-z]{2,}&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">description</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">should return user by id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">request</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  method</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">GET</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  url</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/users/123</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  headers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    Authorization</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Bearer {token}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  matchers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    headers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Authorization</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        regex</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Bearer .+'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">response</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  status</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">200</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  headers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    Content-Type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">application/json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  body</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'abc-123'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Alice'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    email</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'alice@example.com'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  matchers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    body</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">$.id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">by_type</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">$.email</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">by_regex</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        value</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"[a-zA-Z0-9.]+@[a-zA-Z0-9]+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\\\</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.[a-z]{2,}\"</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"提供者侧自动验证\">提供者侧自动验证</h2><p>SCC 的核心价值之一是<strong>零手写测试代码</strong>的提供者验证。Maven/Gradle 插件读取契约定义，自动生成 JUnit 测试类：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"// 自动生成的测试（开发者无需编写）&#10;public class ContractVerifierTest extends UserServiceBase {&#10;&#10;    @Test&#10;    public void validate_shouldReturnUserById() throws Exception {&#10;        // given:&#10;        MockMvcRequestSpecification request = given()&#10;            .header(&quot;Authorization&quot;, &quot;Bearer some-token&quot;);&#10;&#10;        // when:&#10;        ResponseOptions response = given().spec(request)&#10;            .get(&quot;/users/123&quot;);&#10;&#10;        // then:&#10;        assertThat(response.statusCode()).isEqualTo(200);&#10;        assertThat(response.header(&quot;Content-Type&quot;))&#10;            .contains(&quot;application/json&quot;);&#10;&#10;        DocumentContext parsedJson = JsonPath.parse(&#10;            response.getBody().asString());&#10;        assertThatJson(parsedJson).field(&quot;[&#39;id&#39;]&quot;).matches(&quot;[^\\\\s]+&quot;);&#10;        assertThatJson(parsedJson).field(&quot;[&#39;email&#39;]&quot;)&#10;            .matches(&quot;[a-zA-Z0-9.]+@[a-zA-Z0-9]+\\\\.[a-z]{2,}&quot;);&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 自动生成的测试（开发者无需编写）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ContractVerifierTest</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> extends</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> UserServiceBase</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    @</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> validate_shouldReturnUserById</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">throws</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Exception {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // given:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        MockMvcRequestSpecification request </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> given</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">header</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Authorization\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Bearer some-token\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // when:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        ResponseOptions response </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> given</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(request)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"/users/123\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // then:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        assertThat</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(response.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">statusCode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">isEqualTo</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">200</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        assertThat</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(response.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">header</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Content-Type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">contains</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"application/json\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        DocumentContext parsedJson </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> JsonPath.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">parse</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            response.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getBody</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">asString</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        assertThatJson</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(parsedJson).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">field</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"['id']\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">matches</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"[^</span><span